% if ( $c->config->{allow_trial_submissions} ) {

<p>If you have trials on this database that you want to submit to the production database, you can do so 
by clicking the <strong>Submit Trial</strong> button on the trial detail page of each trial you want to 
submit OR you can create a list of multiple trials to submit and submit them all at once from the 
<a href="/submit/trials">Submit Multiple Trials</a> page.</p>

% } else {

<p>If you have trials on this database that you want to submit to the production database, you can:
    <ol>
        <li>Export your data from the Manage > Download Using Lists page for each data type</li>
        <li>Go to the production database at <a href="<% our $T3_PRODUCTION_URL %>"><% $T3_PRODUCTION_URL %></a> and submit your trials there.</li>
    </ol>
</p>

% }
